{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2021-11-09 16:15:00', 'title': 'SVB FINANCIAL GROUP APPOINTS ELIZABETH BURR TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., NOV. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SVB FINANCIAL GROUP (SVB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF ELIZABETH "BUSY" BURR, FORMER PRESIDENT AND CHIEF COMMERCIAL OFFICER OF CARROT, INC., WHO HAS ALSO LED INNOVATION EFFORTS AT CITIGROUP AND HUMANA, TO ITS\xa0BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 8, 2021.'}